cov.out
coverage.out
*.pdf
# ⛔ except a fixture, deliberately. The rule above keeps stray PDFs and corpus
# files out of the repository, and every test here builds the documents it
# needs in code — which is the better habit and stays the default.
#
# testdata/ is the one exception, for a document this package CANNOT build: a
# linearized one. Producing it is precisely what reader does not do yet, so the
# fixture comes from qpdf — and it has to be committed because CI has no qpdf,
# without which the checker's positive tests skip there and the coverage gate
# fails while reading 100% locally.
!testdata/*.pdf
